{"version":2,"width":100,"height":30,"timestamp":1793943633,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"command":"bash examples/multi-hop-demo/run.sh","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.073053, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== Setup\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.073064, "o", "\u001b[2m# attenuo at http://127.0.0.1:50135 proxies a fake GitHub MCP server at port 50136 as 'github'.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.073067, "o", "\u001b[2m# Policy: reads anywhere in acme/, writes only to agent/* branches, never to main. See policy.cedar.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.073087, "o", "\u001b[2m# The policy's tests run offline first (policy_test.yaml).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.073106, "o", "$ attenuo policy test examples/multi-hop-demo/policy_test.yaml\r\n"]
[0.084497, "o", "examples/multi-hop-demo/policy_test.yaml\r\n  ✓ the coder reads a file in acme/api  (allow: policy_allow [read_in_acme])\r\n  ✓ the coder's write to main is refused by policy, though its token allows the write  (deny: policy_deny [no_writes_to_default_branch])\r\n  ✓ a read of a second acme/api repository passes policy (the server's run limit refuses it)  (allow: policy_allow [read_in_acme])\r\n  ✓ the coder cannot open issues, the planner did not delegate create_issue  (deny: capability_denied)\r\n  ✓ the coder cannot read acme repositories outside acme/api  (deny: capability_denied)\r\n  ✓ the coder cannot list issues, even in acme/api  (deny: capability_denied)\r\n"]
[0.084505, "o", "  ✓ the coder may write to an agent branch  (allow: policy_allow [write_to_agent_branches])\r\n  ✓ the planner reads issues across acme  (allow: policy_allow [read_in_acme])\r\n  ✓ the planner opens an issue in acme  (allow: policy_allow [open_issues_in_acme])\r\n"]
[0.084506, "o", "  ✓ the planner's token stops at the acme organisation  (deny: capability_denied)\r\n  ✓ reads outside acme get no permit  (deny: policy_deny)\r\n"]
[0.084519, "o", "  ✓ a write without a branch is refused  (deny: policy_deny [no_writes_to_default_branch])\r\n  ✓ a write to master is refused like one to main  (deny: policy_deny [no_writes_to_default_branch])\r\n  ✓ a third agent below the coder is refused even for a read  (deny: policy_deny [forbid_chains_past_the_coder])\r\n\r\n"]
[0.084521, "o", "14 passed, 0 failed (14 cases in 1 file)\r\nall 5 policies exercised\r\n"]
[0.084737, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 1. Exchange 1, alice -> planner: the planner's root token (hop 1)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.084851, "o", "\u001b[2m# Read files and issues, open issues and write files, all only under acme/. may_act: only the\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.084893, "o", "\u001b[2m# coder may exchange this token. (The dev mint stands in for an OIDC ID token at POST /token.)\u001b[0m\r\n$ attenuo token root --subject alice --agent planner --may-act coder\r\n"]
[0.091551, "o", "lease       4fbbbb09-ae3f-4ee5-bc8f-0dfef496a95a\r\nexpires_in  900s\r\n"]
[0.091642, "o", "token       eyJ0eXAiOiJhdHRlbnVvK2p3...\r\n"]
[0.096829, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 2. The planner looks at the issues it was asked to plan for: allowed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.096832, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$PLANNER\" attenuo call --upstream github --tool list_issues --arg repo=acme/api\r\n"]
[0.104368, "o", "ALLOWED\r\n{\"arguments\":{\"repo\":\"acme/api\"},\"name\":\"list_issues\"}\r\n"]
[0.106648, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 3. Refused exchange: the coder asks for get_file_contents on any repository\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.106667, "o", "\u001b[2m# The coder authenticates as itself (its secret on stdin). The parent's last hop covers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.106669, "o", "\u001b[2m# get_file_contents only under acme/, so a capability with no repo constraint is wider: refused.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.106707, "o", "$ printf \"%s\\n\" demo-coder-secret | ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$PLANNER\" attenuo token exchange --actor coder --client-secret-stdin --cap github:get_file_contents\r\n"]
[0.113788, "o", "error: server answered 400 Bad Request: invalid_scope: delegation chain is invalid: hop 1 widens capabilities relative to hop 0: requested capability `github:get_file_contents` is not covered by the parent capability set\r\ndecision b0cf34fa-ac03-4dc5-8044-4f8ce60af8dd\r\n"]
[0.11917, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 4. Exchange 2, planner -> coder (hop 2), narrowed at every point\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.119175, "o", "\u001b[2m# repo narrowed from acme/ to acme/api, a distinct limit of 1 on repo (one repository per run),\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.119194, "o", "\u001b[2m# no list_issues, no create_issue, and --no-delegation (may_act: []) so nobody may exchange it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.119233, "o", "$ printf \"%s\\n\" demo-coder-secret | ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$PLANNER\" attenuo token exchange --actor coder --client-secret-stdin --no-delegation --ttl-seconds 600 --cap '{\"server\":\"github\",\"tool\":\"get_file_contents\",\"constraints\":{\"repo\":{\"op\":\"prefix\",\"value\":\"acme/api\"}},\"limits\":{\"distinct\":{\"arg\":\"repo\",\"max\":1}}}' --cap '{\"server\":\"github\",\"tool\":\"create_or_update_file\",\"constraints\":{\"repo\":{\"op\":\"prefix\",\"value\":\"acme/api\"}},\"limits\":{\"distinct\":{\"arg\":\"repo\",\"max\":1}}}'\r\n"]
[0.127057, "o", "lease       81a89f7f-874c-4d13-80ab-7b9906460485\r\nexpires_in  600s\r\n"]
[0.127203, "o", "token       eyJ0eXAiOiJhdHRlbnVvK2p3...\r\n"]
[0.132168, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 5. What the coder's token says: two hops, each narrower than the one above\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.132185, "o", "$ attenuo token inspect \"$CODER\" --verify\r\n"]
[0.138579, "o", "user alice  (issuer https://idp.example)\r\n  authenticated 2026-11-06T05:40:34Z\r\n└─ agent planner\r\n     can   github:create_issue {repo starts with \"acme/\"}, github:create_or_update_file {repo starts with \"acme/\"}, github:get_file_contents {repo starts with \"acme/\"}, github:list_issues {repo starts with \"acme/\"}\r\n     until 2026-11-06T05:55:34Z (in 14m 59s)\r\n     lease 4fbbbb09-ae3f-4ee5-bc8f-0dfef496a95a\r\n   └─ agent coder  <- holds this token\r\n        can   github:create_or_update_file {repo starts with \"acme/api\"} [distinct repo <= 1], github:get_file_contents {repo starts with \"acme/api\"} [distinct repo <= 1]\r\n"]
[0.138584, "o", "        until 2026-11-06T05:50:34Z (in 9m 59s)\r\n        lease 81a89f7f-874c-4d13-80ab-7b9906460485\r\n\r\n"]
[0.138585, "o", "iss http://127.0.0.1:50135   aud attenuo   jti 31235c59-4093-4c46-82e0-143045087995\r\n"]
[0.138586, "o", "kid FZZOkzOcXg7ceeb2WYoyvg   ou_kid FZZOkzOcXg7ceeb2WYoyvg\r\n"]
[0.138594, "o", "exp 2026-11-06T05:50:34Z (in 9m 59s)\r\nmay_act []: no agent may exchange this token\r\nverified: signature, type, issuer, audience, expiry, chain\r\n"]
[0.140861, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 6. Exchange 3, refused: the coder tries to hand its token to a reviewer agent\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.140875, "o", "\u001b[2m# The reviewer authenticates fine, but the coder's token carries may_act: [].\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.140902, "o", "$ printf \"%s\\n\" demo-reviewer-secret | ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo token exchange --actor reviewer --client-secret-stdin --cap '{\"server\":\"github\",\"tool\":\"get_file_contents\",\"constraints\":{\"repo\":{\"op\":\"equals\",\"value\":\"acme/api\"}}}'\r\n"]
[0.148049, "o", "error: server answered 400 Bad Request: invalid_request: agent `reviewer` is not permitted to act on this token (may_act)\r\ndecision 7631ccb1-9f9b-408d-8732-3498597499f3\r\n"]
[0.152749, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 7. The coder reads the file it was asked to fix: allowed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.152769, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --upstream github --tool get_file_contents --arg repo=acme/api --arg path=src/lib.rs\r\n"]
[0.159659, "o", "ALLOWED\r\n{\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"src/lib.rs\",\"repo\":\"acme/api\"},\"name\":\"get_file_contents\"}\r\n"]
[0.162257, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 8. The coder pushes its fix straight to main: denied by policy\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.162273, "o", "\u001b[2m# create_or_update_file on acme/api is in the coder's token; the policy wants an agent/* branch.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.162296, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --upstream github --tool create_or_update_file --arg repo=acme/api --arg path=src/lib.rs --arg branch=main --arg content=\"fn fixed() {}\"\r\n"]
[0.169019, "o", "DENIED  policy_deny\r\ndecision 25e30bab-bc61-4b4f-a9e4-bd773e9f7b2e\r\n"]
[0.173943, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 9. The coder tries to open an issue: denied, the planner never delegated create_issue\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.173961, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --upstream github --tool create_issue --arg repo=acme/api --arg title=\"fix pushed\"\r\n"]
[0.180265, "o", "DENIED  capability_denied\r\ndecision e4b19f19-8447-4826-a879-2d52bde457fe\r\n"]
[0.182447, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 10. The coder reads from a second repository under acme/api: denied by the run limit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.182462, "o", "\u001b[2m# acme/api-client is inside the coder's repo prefix and the policy allows the read, but the\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.182476, "o", "\u001b[2m# distinct limit allows one repository per run and acme/api was the first.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.182493, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --upstream github --tool get_file_contents --arg repo=acme/api-client --arg path=README.md\r\n"]
[0.188814, "o", "DENIED  budget_exhausted\r\ndecision ea5c3f17-98df-4499-a764-58d1ceb3e23c\r\n"]
[0.191017, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 11. The operator looks at the chain before acting\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.19104, "o", "\u001b[2m# The chain id is the planner's lease, the first hop's (also the chain_id of every audit record).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.191056, "o", "$ attenuo lease tree \"$PLANNER_LEASE\"\r\n"]
[0.197462, "o", "root lease (no ancestors)\r\n4fbbbb09-ae3f-4ee5-bc8f-0dfef496a95a  planner  active, expires 2026-11-06T05:45:34.072406Z  issued #1\r\n└─ 81a89f7f-874c-4d13-80ab-7b9906460485  coder  active, expires 2026-11-06T05:45:34.107196Z  issued #6\r\n        limit github/create_or_update_file distinct repo 0/1 (1 left)\r\n        limit github/get_file_contents distinct repo 1/1 (0 left)\r\nwould revoke 2 lease(s) if revoked now\r\n"]
[0.197624, "o", "$ attenuo lease revoke --chain-id \"$PLANNER_LEASE\" --preview\r\n"]
[0.204016, "o", "preview: nothing was changed\r\nselector  chain_id 4fbbbb09-ae3f-4ee5-bc8f-0dfef496a95a\r\nmatched   2 lease(s)\r\nwould revoke 2 lease(s)\r\n  4fbbbb09-ae3f-4ee5-bc8f-0dfef496a95a\r\n  81a89f7f-874c-4d13-80ab-7b9906460485\r\n"]
[0.204177, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 12. The operator revokes the whole chain by chain_id\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.204204, "o", "$ attenuo lease revoke --chain-id \"$PLANNER_LEASE\" --reason \"planner run went wrong\"\r\n"]
[0.210286, "o", "selector  chain_id 4fbbbb09-ae3f-4ee5-bc8f-0dfef496a95a\r\nmatched   2 lease(s)\r\nrevoked 2 lease(s)\r\n  4fbbbb09-ae3f-4ee5-bc8f-0dfef496a95a\r\n  81a89f7f-874c-4d13-80ab-7b9906460485\r\nreason    planner run went wrong\r\naudit     20004c72-b952-442c-9caf-e65da1a1acbe\r\n"]
[0.212611, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 13. The coder's next call, even the one that worked before, is denied\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.212639, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --upstream github --tool get_file_contents --arg repo=acme/api --arg path=src/lib.rs\r\n"]
[0.218498, "o", "DENIED  lease_revoked\r\ndecision 2301ae6c-95cf-4248-a2fd-3543b71b02a5\r\n"]
[0.220949, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 14. The audit log records every decision, and its hash chain checks out\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.220969, "o", "$ attenuo audit tail -n 50\r\n"]
[0.22744, "o", "#1    2026-11-06T05:40:34.072406Z  ALLOW attenuo/token.root  planner for alice  reason=token_issued  id=a8ae645f-42a4-45a1-8acb-baf6c8c4f46e\r\n#2    2026-11-06T05:40:34.072406Z  ALLOW attenuo/admin.root_token  by urn:attenuo:admin  reason=admin_action  id=49dfe64c-1ada-4521-9003-64c10898d830\r\n#3    2026-11-06T05:40:34.083892Z  ALLOW github/list_issues  planner for alice  reason=policy_allow  id=e65d4f3a-98b9-42e4-b599-0da356b2a3dc\r\n#4    2026-11-06T05:40:34.084771Z  tool_result  github/list_issues  planner for alice  decision=e65d4f3a-98b9-42e4-b599-0da356b2a3dc  label=untrusted size=119  id=1c1e5854-cfd6-42ef-a7c3-c4111f0cf061\r\n#5    2026-11-06T05:40:34.094436Z  DENY  attenuo/token.exchange  planner for alice  reason=exchange_widening  id=b0cf34fa-ac03-4dc5-8044-4f8ce60af8dd\r\n"]
[0.227447, "o", "#6    2026-11-06T05:40:34.107196Z  ALLOW attenuo/token.exchange  planner > coder for alice  reason=token_issued  id=a7ea5531-552f-4566-b88a-a5c5ea3e283c\r\n#7    2026-11-06T05:40:34.128733Z  DENY  attenuo/token.exchange  planner > coder for alice  reason=exchange_actor_not_permitted  id=7631ccb1-9f9b-408d-8732-3498597499f3\r\n"]
[0.227449, "o", "#8    2026-11-06T05:40:34.139722Z  ALLOW github/get_file_contents  planner > coder for alice  reason=policy_allow  id=b9a16244-afce-4a29-8733-b3104b97df2f\r\n#9    2026-11-06T05:40:34.140405Z  tool_result  github/get_file_contents  planner > coder for alice  decision=b9a16244-afce-4a29-8733-b3104b97df2f  label=untrusted size=149  id=fdd2f0ea-f724-4d42-982d-23e49eda9c88\r\n"]
[0.227459, "o", "#10   2026-11-06T05:40:34.149279Z  DENY  github/create_or_update_file  planner > coder for alice  reason=policy_deny  id=25e30bab-bc61-4b4f-a9e4-bd773e9f7b2e\r\n#11   2026-11-06T05:40:34.161231Z  DENY  github/create_issue  planner > coder for alice  reason=capability_denied  id=e4b19f19-8447-4826-a879-2d52bde457fe\r\n#12   2026-11-06T05:40:34.169773Z  DENY  github/get_file_contents  planner > coder for alice  reason=budget_exhausted  id=ea5c3f17-98df-4499-a764-58d1ceb3e23c\r\n"]
[0.22746, "o", "#13   2026-11-06T05:40:34.191061Z  ALLOW attenuo/admin.lease.revoke  by urn:attenuo:admin  reason=admin_action  id=20004c72-b952-442c-9caf-e65da1a1acbe\r\n"]
[0.227471, "o", "#14   2026-11-06T05:40:34.199459Z  DENY  github/get_file_contents  planner > coder for alice  reason=lease_revoked  id=2301ae6c-95cf-4248-a2fd-3543b71b02a5\r\n"]
[0.227662, "o", "$ attenuo audit verify\r\n"]
[0.233354, "o", "audit chain OK: 14 entries verified\r\ncheckpoints: none signed yet\r\n"]
[0.236228, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 15. The refused widening exchange is in the log too\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m# A refused exchange whose subject token verified is a deny record against the parent's chain.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.236234, "o", "$ attenuo audit show --id \"$WIDEN_DECISION\"\r\n"]
[0.242507, "o", "#5    2026-11-06T05:40:34.094436Z  DENY  attenuo/token.exchange  planner for alice  reason=exchange_widening  id=b0cf34fa-ac03-4dc5-8044-4f8ce60af8dd\r\nkind        decision\r\nchain       4fbbbb09-ae3f-4ee5-bc8f-0dfef496a95a\r\nhash        09c749ad26666a62104dfa335ed238291f0c41c3973e7f3da1d5836a0a5815eb\r\nprev hash   088c7a924dfa18acc5679c99a024ad515f28b20ca51c95f208b6441f66fd0f14\r\nleases      (root first, as the registry sees them now)\r\n  4fbbbb09-ae3f-4ee5-bc8f-0dfef496a95a  REVOKED 2026-11-06T05:40:34.191061Z (planner run went wrong)\r\n"]
[0.24251, "o", "checkpoint  none yet: the entry is newer than every checkpoint, only the hash chain covers it\r\npolicy      not reloaded since this entry\r\n"]
[0.244896, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 16. The decision chain of the refused write\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.244916, "o", "\u001b[2m# The record names both hops, the policy that decided, the leases (revoked now) and its hashes.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.24492, "o", "$ attenuo audit show --id \"$WRITE_DECISION\"\r\n"]
[0.250528, "o", "#10   2026-11-06T05:40:34.149279Z  DENY  github/create_or_update_file  planner > coder for alice  reason=policy_deny  id=25e30bab-bc61-4b4f-a9e4-bd773e9f7b2e\r\nkind        decision\r\nchain       4fbbbb09-ae3f-4ee5-bc8f-0dfef496a95a\r\npolicies    no_writes_to_default_branch\r\nhash        0fc1d15c6b9fecc0000c825e82c6399987f86b4ae0edce4f9bf0c718b185f974\r\nprev hash   9d3f8c771dbbf282298d75c999f7cc5cfeb883d38e7bd2c1af08b85bb9a07da2\r\nleases      (root first, as the registry sees them now)\r\n  4fbbbb09-ae3f-4ee5-bc8f-0dfef496a95a  REVOKED 2026-11-06T05:40:34.191061Z (planner run went wrong)\r\n"]
[0.250531, "o", "  81a89f7f-874c-4d13-80ab-7b9906460485  REVOKED 2026-11-06T05:40:34.191061Z (planner run went wrong)\r\ncheckpoint  none yet: the entry is newer than every checkpoint, only the hash chain covers it\r\n"]
[0.250532, "o", "policy      not reloaded since this entry\r\n"]
[0.252968, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== What reached the GitHub server\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.256573, "o", "  fake-mcp: tools/call list_issues {\"repo\":\"acme/api\"}\r\n  fake-mcp: tools/call get_file_contents {\"path\":\"src/lib.rs\",\"repo\":\"acme/api\"}\r\n"]
[0.256729, "o", "  -> 2 tools/calls reached upstream (the planner's list and the coder's read). The four denied calls never left attenuo.\r\n"]
[0.260144, "x", "0"]
